          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apot ngitunga a ekitela a Sebulun nyiiritasi ngitunga lu alomito lorerea a Kitiron ka Naalal, nakaneni apot Ngikanaan ngulu toloma neni aapei ka kesi, nabo kidesikinae akisub etich.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.1.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
